	Connect a datafeed to an input of an I.460 MUX.
apifn	sm_i460mux_datafeed_connect
params	sm_i460mux_datafeed_connect_parms datafeedp
	The datafeed object to be connected. 
field	tSMDatafeedId data_source in
	The mux to connect the datafeed to.
field	tSMI460muxId i460mux in
	The mux input to which the datafeed has been connected.
field	tSMI460InputId input_id out
unstruct
	Connect a datafeed to one of the inputs of the I.460 mux.
	Up to eight datafeeds may be connected to a single I.460 mux.
	The datafeed is assumed to be carrying a datastream that has already been 
	uprated by being masked into the correct bit(s) of each octet. This can 
	be achieved by using the datatx firmware module, configured with an 
	appropriate i460_mask. It is up to the user to ensure that the masks 
	used by different datafeeds connected to the same I.460 mux do not overlap.
explain
	0
retval
error   ERR_SM_DEVERR - device error
error   ERR_SM_NO_RESOURCES - no free inputs available

